# Applies to the `stack` named build context of Dockerfile.errow (docker build --build-context stack=vendetta-stack/errow).
# Only the stack's own runtime assets are needed; everything else (feedback-loop, mcp, shipper, docs, tests, logs) stays out.
*
!entrypoint.sh
!dind-ready.py
!stack-config.py
!config/errow-config.yaml
!config/llm-providers.yaml
!tui/bridge/go.mod
!tui/bridge/*.go
!viewer/dist/static
